1
00:00:00,220 --> 00:00:01,740
Only three tickets left.

2
00:00:02,033 --> 00:00:02,840
Could we still win?

3
00:00:03,332 --> 00:00:04,728
This conquest match

4
00:00:04,970 --> 00:00:06,140
ended in a very close victory.

5
00:00:07,387 --> 00:00:09,582
This is the Battlefield mode in Swarm Siege.

6
00:00:10,087 --> 00:00:12,682
Old Town, Comms Station and Supply Depot:

7
00:00:12,974 --> 00:00:14,269
these are the three objectives.

8
00:00:15,520 --> 00:00:16,540
Control two objectives

9
00:00:16,682 --> 00:00:18,740
and the enemy keeps losing tickets.

10
00:00:19,220 --> 00:00:20,265
Chase enemies while

11
00:00:20,495 --> 00:00:21,390
your flags get taken,

12
00:00:21,582 --> 00:00:22,502
and you can still lose.

13
00:00:22,995 --> 00:00:24,228
If you like this mode,

14
00:00:24,432 --> 00:00:25,490
leave a like.

15
00:00:26,753 --> 00:00:28,586
There is no troop purchasing or leveling up here.

16
00:00:29,091 --> 00:00:30,936
Five classes have fixed loadouts.

17
00:00:31,216 --> 00:00:32,661
I choose Engineer at the start

18
00:00:33,016 --> 00:00:34,198
and push forward in a tank.

19
00:00:35,453 --> 00:00:37,836
This vehicle footage is from a separate match.

20
00:00:38,341 --> 00:00:39,798
The tank advances along the road.

21
00:00:40,053 --> 00:00:41,323
Its armor drops when it takes hits.

22
00:00:41,528 --> 00:00:43,086
Infantry are moving toward the objectives too.

23
00:00:44,353 --> 00:00:45,386
Back in the main match,

24
00:00:45,666 --> 00:00:46,848
I went down in the first push.

25
00:00:47,341 --> 00:00:50,598
Select our captured depot instead of running from HQ,

26
00:00:50,753 --> 00:00:51,873
switch to Medic,

27
00:00:51,978 --> 00:00:53,061
and redeploy near the front.

28
00:00:54,320 --> 00:00:55,878
Use support when hurt

29
00:00:56,207 --> 00:00:57,440
to recover health.

30
00:00:57,932 --> 00:00:59,128
Staying alive inside the objective

31
00:00:59,370 --> 00:01:01,328
helps more than rushing out and dying again.

32
00:01:02,587 --> 00:01:04,769
The central Comms Station changes hands repeatedly.

33
00:01:05,274 --> 00:01:06,732
I fight from cover

34
00:01:06,937 --> 00:01:08,369
and throw a grenade toward the junction.

35
00:01:08,874 --> 00:01:10,907
The enemy uses vehicles and counterattacks too.

36
00:01:11,137 --> 00:01:12,507
I cannot just keep charging straight in.

37
00:01:13,753 --> 00:01:14,486
By the end,

38
00:01:14,753 --> 00:01:16,348
both teams were almost out of tickets.

39
00:01:16,841 --> 00:01:18,811
We held Comms Station and Supply Depot.

40
00:01:19,091 --> 00:01:20,398
The enemy reached zero;

41
00:01:20,603 --> 00:01:21,761
we had three left.

42
00:01:23,020 --> 00:01:25,952
The result is interesting: our team scored 94 kills,

43
00:01:26,208 --> 00:01:27,302
and theirs scored 105.

44
00:01:27,808 --> 00:01:29,090
The team with more kills

45
00:01:29,320 --> 00:01:30,190
still lost.

46
00:01:30,682 --> 00:01:32,102
Objectives and staying alive

47
00:01:32,332 --> 00:01:33,227
both matter.

48
00:01:34,487 --> 00:01:36,257
We won this match through objective control,

49
00:01:36,599 --> 00:01:38,569
but direct charges were still deadly.

50
00:01:39,074 --> 00:01:42,057
Next time I want to try class teamwork and flanking.

51
00:01:42,562 --> 00:01:45,232
You can now play 虫潮围城, Swarm Siege, on the Treasure Box website.

52
00:01:45,512 --> 00:01:47,507
You can also submit a game idea to the wishlist.
